␀␀1 kg weighs about 9.8 N on Earth.␀␀␀The atmosphere is 101 kPa, about 14.7 psi.␀␀Absolute: water freezes at 0 C, or 273.15 K.␀␀␀␀A difference: 10 C deg warmer is 10 K, 18 F deg.␀␀␀␀Walking is about 1.4 m/s; 60 mph is 26.8 m/s.␀␀␀A full turn is 360 deg, or 6.28 radians.␀␀␀␀1000 rpm is about 105 rad/s.␀␀␀␀Water is 1000 kg/m^3, air about 1.2.␀␀␀␀Type mixed units too: 1h 20m.␀␀␀A AA cell holds about 2500 mAh.␀THE SAME VALUE IN OTHER UNITS: TAP TO USE␀␀␀COMMON UNITS: TAP TO USE␀␀␀␀Formulas␀␀␀␀Type to search: ohm, watts, kinetic, lens...␀␀␀␀%d␀␀Nothing found␀␀␀Two solutions. The other: ␀␀Enter %d more value%s␀␀␀Equation %d of %d: tap for the next␀Solved␀␀A plain number, no unit␀In ␀A plain number, no unit.␀␀␀␀Measured in ␀␀␀␀: units␀Tap outside to close␀␀␀␀HANDY VALUES␀␀␀␀page %d of %d␀␀␀/macros.json␀␀␀␀littlefs␀␀␀␀/littlefs␀␀␀macros: saved layout is bad (%s), using the example
